      "content": "hey... I know we were supposed to work on my quarterly goals this week but honestly I don't even know why I bother. like every single thing we set out to do this year has just... fallen apart. the fitness stuff, my business idea, my relationship ended last month. I've failed at literally everything. I'm starting to think I'm just not the kind of person who can actually DO things, you know? like some people are built for success and some people just aren't. and I think I'm the second kind",
