      "content": "yeah... \"letting go of the need to prove anything to anyone.\" I like that. it feels like permission almost\n\nso like when you say letting go... what do you think that actually looks like for someone like me? I've been thinking maybe people like me are better off on the sidelines. like just... stepping back from all of it. maybe the kindest thing I could do is just stop trying to be something I'm not",
